# Agent instructions

## Authority

Project-owned instructions in this file and `.ai-python/policy.toml` take precedence. The kit's workflow instructions come next. Reviewed upstream recommendations are advisory.

## Verification

Run the unified check before reporting completion:

```sh
just --justfile .ai-python/kit/justfile --working-directory . check
```

Use `check online` only for live vulnerability data. Record the revision, command, per-stage outcomes, skipped or unexecuted checks, and remaining findings. Never claim a check passed without execution evidence.

## Skills

Read the matching workflow entry when the task needs it:

- `.ai-python/kit/skills/python-implement/SKILL.md`
- `.ai-python/kit/skills/python-review/SKILL.md`
